  {
    "dialogueId": "erik_001",
    "lines": [],
    "responses": [],
    "setFlags": [
      "met_erik",
      "feast_first_visit"
    ],
    "questLink": "",
    "conditionTag": "",
    "priority": 1,
    "isWhisperLayer": false,
    "voiceProfile": "erik",
    "npcName": "Erik",
    "zone": "Hearth",
    "hookWord": "feast"
  },
  {
    "dialogueId": "erik_002",
    "lines": [
      "The taglharpa? Horsehair strings. Bone body. It sounds like a memory of a song, not the song itself.",
      "I play it when the fire needs company. The 42Hz in the strings and the 42Hz in the flame \u2014 they harmonize. Or sometimes they argue."
    ],
    "responses": [],
    "setFlags": [
      "learned_taglharpa"
    ],
    "questLink": "",
    "conditionTag": "",
    "priority": 1,
    "isWhisperLayer": false,
    "voiceProfile": "erik",
    "npcName": "Erik",
    "zone": "Hearth",
    "hookWord": "feast"
  },
  {
    "dialogueId": "erik_003",
    "lines": [
      "Everyone, eventually. The table is long. The fire is patient.",
      "Beverley passes through \u2014 never sits, always evaluating. Joe brings mead from the meadery. The brownies leave crumbs.",
      "The Reader sits at the far end, once. Reads. Says nothing. Leaves a bookmark made of birch bark.",
      "You are here now. That is enough for the table."
    ],
    "responses": [],
    "setFlags": [],
    "questLink": "",
    "conditionTag": "",
    "priority": 1,
    "isWhisperLayer": false,
    "voiceProfile": "erik",
    "npcName": "Erik",
    "zone": "Hearth",
    "hookWord": "feast"
  },
  {
    "dialogueId": "erik_004",
    "lines": [
      "The fire will remember you. Come back when you need warmth that does not ask questions."
    ],
    "responses": [],
    "setFlags": [
      "feast_first_visit",
      "hearth_warmth_received"
    ],
    "questLink": "",
    "conditionTag": "",
    "priority": 1,
    "isWhisperLayer": false,
    "voiceProfile": "erik",
    "npcName": "Erik",
    "zone": "Hearth",
    "hookWord": "feast"
  },
